# ================================
# One-off URDF->USD conversion scripts
# ================================
# Near-identical per-robot copies of tools/convert_urdf.py, run by hand to produce the
# USDs under assets/ (itself ignored). Kept locally, not tracked: the conversion
# parameters that matter are recorded in robots/unitree.py alongside each config.
